@startuml
[*] --> Open : create
Open --> InProgress : assign
InProgress --> Review : submit
Review --> InProgress : changes requested
Review --> Done : approve
Done --> [*]
InProgress --> Blocked : dependency
Blocked --> InProgress : unblock
state Done {
  [*] --> Merged
  Merged --> Deployed
}
note right of Blocked
  Waiting for an
  external team
end note
@enduml
